{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tincho the capybara has just discovered there's more to eat than grass.</strong> In this 2D platformer adventure, Tincho travels across different regions of Argentina to explore its cuisine and help prepare traditional dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels inspired by real-life landscapes, search for the right ingredients, and team up with native animals like Wadu the penguin, the caiman, and the coati. Each one has a role in the kitchen: chopping, mixing, or cooking. If you do everything in the right order, you'll complete the dish and move on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short game includes two playable characters and sample levels to try out the minigames, humor, and educational style of the game. Perfect for platformer fans looking for a cultural twist.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2172050?t=1759924006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759924006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172050/57ca96d802caf092bf32b7e82f5ee68c9fd49b5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759924006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172050/57ca96d802caf092bf32b7e82f5ee68c9fd49b5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759924006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tincho the capybara has just discovered there's more to eat than grass.</strong> In this 2D platformer adventure, Tincho travels across different regions of Argentina to explore its cuisine and help prepare traditional dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels inspired by real-life landscapes, search for the right ingredients, and team up with native animals like Wadu the penguin, the caiman, and the coati. Each one has a role in the kitchen: chopping, mixing, or cooking. If you do everything in the right order, you'll complete the dish and move on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short game includes two playable characters and sample levels to try out the minigames, humor, and educational style of the game. Perfect for platformer fans looking for a cultural twist.</p>","developers":["B\u00e1rbara Ruggieri","Leandro Navarro","Jow\u00e9n Cap\u00f3","Juan S Rey"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172050/0c86c97a348300ce14afbfabe35294d184df5935/header.jpg?t=1759924006","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Marca registrada en la argentina.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2172050/632130/aa332e710439b9bafb6df5e5d45d3380fdd8454f/1751085178/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749588075","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2172050/632130/aa332e710439b9bafb6df5e5d45d3380fdd8454f/1751085178/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749588075","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2172050/632130/aa332e710439b9bafb6df5e5d45d3380fdd8454f/1751085178/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749588075","id":256983970,"name":"Tincho Aventuras a la Carta","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256983970/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1749588075"}],"name":"Tincho Aventuras a la Carta","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Alphagonia"],"ratings":{"d